[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 18242.47, "timestamp": "05:04:02", "text": "性别是，如果那件事发生了，他可能会……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18245.83, "timestamp": "05:04:05", "text": "感觉就像踩到了盐一样。是的。和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18247.83, "timestamp": "05:04:07", "text": "还有一件好事，如果你有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18251.67, "timestamp": "05:04:11", "text": "十字架，没错，它会让人反感，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18253.91, "timestamp": "05:04:13", "text": "稍后回来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18256.948, "timestamp": "05:04:16", "text": "啊，对，这就是十字架的原因。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18265.83, "timestamp": "05:04:25", "text": "你当时就看到我站在那里了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18268.39, "timestamp": "05:04:28", "text": "就像他或她在打猎一样。所以现在你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18271.03, "timestamp": "05:04:31", "text": "知道该做什么。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18272.55, "timestamp": "05:04:32", "text": "哦，你确实有。你还有吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18274.47, "timestamp": "05:04:34", "text": "盐？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18277.27, "timestamp": "05:04:37", "text": "我没有。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18280.788, "timestamp": "05:04:40", "text": "啊，糟糕。那么你本来可以这样做："}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18283.35, "timestamp": "05:04:43", "text": "把盐放在门口附近，然后出去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18285.99, "timestamp": "05:04:45", "text": "出去，给她打了个电话，她就可以进来了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18287.83, "timestamp": "05:04:47", "text": "是的。所以即使你死了，你也能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18290.948, "timestamp": "05:04:50", "text": "完成一件事。是的。等等，所以她"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18294.868, "timestamp": "05:04:54", "text": "目前有狩猎活动吗？是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18296.628, "timestamp": "05:04:56", "text": "圣。你看到她了，对吧？站在那里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18299.19, "timestamp": "05:04:59", "text": "在你面前。是的。是的，她是"}]